# Files under the repo root that the cybersecurity-portfolio Worker must not
# serve as static assets (same syntax as .gitignore).
#
# intel-brief/ is a separate project: Cloudflare Workers Builds deploys its
# rendered site (intel-brief/site) to its own Worker on intel.brycemaxheimer.com,
# using intel-brief/wrangler.jsonc. Its code, data and tests are not part of
# brycemaxheimer.com.
intel-brief/
.github/
.assetsignore
